id: pm-b86q
title: Make diff coverage deterministic across supported Node runtimes
description: "Identify the missed diff branch behind 99.95 percent aggregate coverage on main. Add deterministic behavioral coverage with real nongit SDK trackers and OS processes for races, without changing thresholds or exclusions. CI verifies full Node 22 and 26 gates."
type: Issue
status: closed
priority: 1
tags[3]: coverage,"gh:unbraind/pm-presets#194",regression
