close_reason: "https://github.com/unbraind/pm-presets/pull/203 merged 2026-11-09T18:42:51Z; merge SHA f21bf7c80b9a770594022b0d0d3583d36732ee0d; PR head 1dbdc89fbf785e19b3094fafb8054b2ac1b59584. Delivered: Deterministic selected-inventory diff coverage across Node runtimes with an exact-expression behavioral revert and unchanged runtime semantics and thresholds. Green at that head: test (22), codeql, test (26), simulation-release-gates, windows-prepare-lifecycle, CodeQL, CodeRabbit, Greptile Review, Hound. Other check outcomes: enable-auto-merge: SKIPPED; cubic · AI code reviewer: NEUTRAL; Sourcery review: SKIPPED (not counted as green)."
